WEBVTT

01:49.560 --> 01:54.910
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.020 --> 01:58.020
[Episode 2]

02:11.840 --> 02:12.680
My head hurts.

02:21.710 --> 02:23.030
My Lady!

02:23.650 --> 02:24.510
My Lady,

02:24.560 --> 02:26.190
you can tell us
if you want to drink water.

02:26.190 --> 02:27.120
It's winter.

02:27.120 --> 02:28.630
Why did you do it yourself?

02:28.630 --> 02:29.590
Your body is so weak.

02:29.590 --> 02:31.310
Zhixia, Zhixia.

02:31.750 --> 02:33.590
Who's the one that's weak?

02:33.610 --> 02:34.800
Help her sit down.

02:34.829 --> 02:37.360
There's another tough battle
to fight later.

02:37.960 --> 02:38.820
A tough battle?

02:38.829 --> 02:40.090
What battle?

02:40.310 --> 02:41.030
My Lady,

02:41.030 --> 02:43.560
why do you seem different today?

02:44.560 --> 02:46.150
I'm in a hurry.

02:46.360 --> 02:47.590
Finish the procedure

02:47.590 --> 02:49.320
so that I can relax completely.

02:49.360 --> 02:51.560
The poisonous wine was
too strong this time.

02:51.560 --> 02:53.150
I have to crack it.

02:54.190 --> 02:55.650
Where is my wedding dress?

02:56.910 --> 02:58.310
Bring it here.

02:58.310 --> 02:58.750
Put it on for me.

02:58.750 --> 02:59.770
W-Wedding dress?

02:59.790 --> 03:00.980
What wedding dress?

03:02.180 --> 03:03.390
Okay.

03:04.030 --> 03:06.430
You won't even say the
fixed line this time?

03:07.710 --> 03:08.520
Forget it.

03:08.750 --> 03:10.280
I'll die anyway.

03:10.400 --> 03:11.400
I can wear anything.

03:11.400 --> 03:12.030
Let's go.

03:12.030 --> 03:13.360
Hurry up. Follow me.

03:20.310 --> 03:21.030
My Lady.

03:21.030 --> 03:21.870
My Lady.

03:22.240 --> 03:23.030
This...

03:23.030 --> 03:23.840
My Lady!

03:24.400 --> 03:25.190
My Lady.

03:25.980 --> 03:27.310
You're being ridiculous.

03:27.310 --> 03:28.120
It's freezing!

03:28.120 --> 03:29.360
How can you run out in your inner robe?

03:29.360 --> 03:30.800
Where are the firecrackers?

03:30.800 --> 03:31.930
Where's the red silk

03:32.150 --> 03:33.630
and my dowries?

03:34.960 --> 03:36.780
This...

03:36.810 --> 03:38.800
Is it the Song Residence or not?

03:39.070 --> 03:40.840
Am I still Song Yimeng?

03:40.960 --> 03:42.280
What's wrong with you?

03:42.900 --> 03:43.940
Oh, yes.

03:44.360 --> 03:45.490
The wedding procession

03:45.490 --> 03:46.610
and Chu Guihong.

03:46.530 --> 03:50.200
[Persistence]

03:46.650 --> 03:48.520
Yingqiu, go get a doctor.

03:48.520 --> 03:49.240
My Lady!

03:49.350 --> 03:50.510
My Lady!

03:50.620 --> 03:57.500
[Song Residence]

03:58.190 --> 03:59.400
Since this time

03:59.750 --> 04:02.540
I managed to travel to
half a year before my wedding,

04:02.540 --> 04:04.660
I have to enjoy it.

04:06.600 --> 04:07.780
My Lady!

04:07.060 --> 04:09.500
♪ When eating grapes,
don't spit out the skin ♪

04:11.160 --> 04:13.520
♪ When not eating grapes,
spit out the skin ♪

04:13.000 --> 04:13.800
This is...

04:14.470 --> 04:15.470
The doctor said

04:15.240 --> 04:16.339
♪ When eating grapes,
don't spit out the skin ♪

04:15.520 --> 04:17.269
you've been in a bad mood for days.

04:17.269 --> 04:18.630
That's why you have hysteria.

04:17.339 --> 04:18.140
♪ When not eating grapes,
spit out the skin ♪

04:18.680 --> 04:20.480
Master and Madam increased
your pocket money

04:18.930 --> 04:21.070
♪ I'll spit out the skin if I want ♪

04:20.480 --> 04:21.990
to calm you down.

04:25.000 --> 04:25.800
You...

04:26.090 --> 04:27.630
You rich people

04:27.630 --> 04:28.810
call this

04:28.830 --> 04:29.830
"pocket money?"

04:30.650 --> 04:31.750
Zhixia, come here.

04:31.770 --> 04:32.990
Come here.

04:34.720 --> 04:35.510
Xia,

04:35.750 --> 04:38.060
tell me about my family background again.

04:38.060 --> 04:40.050
Let me temper my mind and character.

04:40.050 --> 04:40.730
Yes.

04:40.800 --> 04:42.830
My Lady, listen carefully.

04:43.000 --> 04:45.159
You live outside the most bustling
stone bridge in the capital.

04:45.159 --> 04:46.870
It's near the palace of the
Great Jing Dynasty.

04:46.870 --> 04:48.750
The traffic is convenient
with many stores around.

04:48.750 --> 04:50.600
It's basically an ancient CBD.

04:50.530 --> 04:56.170
[Natural Talent]

04:50.600 --> 04:51.950
The Song Residence has 100 maids,

04:51.950 --> 04:52.830
100 servants,

04:52.830 --> 04:53.680
and 100 attendants.

04:53.680 --> 04:54.950
There are also 100 servants each working

04:54.950 --> 04:56.040
in the kitchen, garden,
and accounting office,

04:56.040 --> 04:57.360
taking care of the masters'

04:57.360 --> 04:58.120
daily life.

04:59.680 --> 05:00.720
Get up.

05:00.200 --> 05:04.470
[Persistence]

05:00.740 --> 05:01.600
Be specific.

05:01.600 --> 05:02.510
How is the daily life

05:02.510 --> 05:03.600
of a wealthy person

05:03.600 --> 05:04.700
like me?

05:04.750 --> 05:05.600
Your hands

05:05.600 --> 05:06.800
are noble hands.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.630
You shouldn't

05:07.630 --> 05:09.800
suffer any hardships.

05:07.810 --> 05:10.930
♪ Capital of the Great Jing Dynasty ♪

05:10.070 --> 05:10.830
Your mouth

05:10.830 --> 05:11.950
is a delicate mouth.

05:10.960 --> 05:16.300
♪ The Duke of Guangping outside the
stone bridge in the west of the city ♪

05:11.950 --> 05:13.000
Ordinary things

05:13.000 --> 05:14.870
don't deserve to be eaten by you.

05:16.330 --> 05:19.130
♪ Vice Minister of War, Song Yude ♪

05:16.630 --> 05:17.430
Reward.

05:19.150 --> 05:21.580
♪ Song Yimeng of
Mr. Song's Song Residence ♪

05:23.060 --> 05:23.600
♪ I am her ♪

05:23.920 --> 05:24.430
♪ I am her ♪

05:24.740 --> 05:25.890
♪ I am Song Yimeng ♪

05:26.190 --> 05:28.490
♪ It's her; I live in
Song Yimeng's house ♪

05:29.430 --> 05:30.240
My Lady.

05:31.430 --> 05:32.270
Change it.

05:33.310 --> 05:34.120
Sour.

05:34.600 --> 05:35.390
My Lady.

05:42.480 --> 05:43.830
How can

05:44.390 --> 05:46.000
grapes have seeds?

05:46.980 --> 05:48.310
Pass my order on.

05:48.680 --> 05:49.720
From now on,

05:50.430 --> 05:52.430
no grapes in the Great Jing Dynasty

05:52.630 --> 05:54.510
is allowed to have seeds.

05:54.510 --> 05:55.310
From now on,

05:55.880 --> 05:57.870
no grapes in the Great Jing Dynasty

05:57.870 --> 05:59.590
is allowed to have seeds.

05:59.710 --> 06:01.270
From now on,

06:01.430 --> 06:03.360
no grapes in the Great Jing Dynasty

06:02.620 --> 06:04.080
♪ When eating grapes,
don't spit out seeds ♪

06:03.360 --> 06:05.040
is allowed to have seeds.

06:04.820 --> 06:05.980
♪ When not eating grapes,
spit out the seeds ♪

06:05.480 --> 06:06.800
From now on,

06:06.540 --> 06:09.110
♪ All grapes here are not
allowed to grow seeds ♪

06:06.800 --> 06:08.870
no grapes in the Great Jing Dynasty

06:08.870 --> 06:10.600
is allowed to have seeds.

06:19.370 --> 06:21.230
This is not the Dream of Qingning.

06:21.600 --> 06:24.530
It's practically the ancient
version of Tiny Times.

06:26.310 --> 06:27.120
Come.

06:27.390 --> 06:28.190
Come.

06:28.870 --> 06:29.870
Hold it steadily.

06:32.070 --> 06:33.800
We gather here today

06:33.800 --> 06:35.950
to celebrate my rebirth

06:35.950 --> 06:37.310
and official start of

06:37.310 --> 06:39.870
a new life of not working.

06:39.920 --> 06:40.680
I,

06:40.680 --> 06:41.630
Diva Meng,

06:41.750 --> 06:43.159
has risen from the ashes.

06:43.240 --> 06:44.580
I only have one purpose,

06:44.720 --> 06:46.950
which is to cherish life

06:46.970 --> 06:48.500
and stay away from Nan Heng.

06:50.180 --> 06:51.030
Cheers.

06:53.360 --> 06:54.159
My Lady,

06:54.770 --> 06:56.770
why don't I get you another doctor?

06:57.510 --> 06:58.750
What doctor?

06:58.750 --> 07:00.430
He can't cure me.

07:00.430 --> 07:02.360
The only cure is a change of fate.

07:05.920 --> 07:06.720
Here.

07:07.720 --> 07:08.870
I want to ask you

07:08.870 --> 07:11.310
about my marriage with Chu Guihong.

07:11.310 --> 07:12.240
What part

07:12.260 --> 07:13.600
of the plot are we at?

07:16.310 --> 07:17.120
That day,

07:17.120 --> 07:18.430
he fought against Heyuan's

07:18.430 --> 07:21.150
30,000 soldiers by himself.

07:22.630 --> 07:26.180
[The fourth city of the border, Youcheng]

07:39.480 --> 07:40.280
General Fang.

07:42.870 --> 07:43.680
Your turn.

07:44.940 --> 07:47.870
[Fang Shiming, Top General of Heyuan]

07:48.560 --> 07:50.820
General Fang is the top player of Heyuan,

07:51.310 --> 07:53.240
a self-proclaimed chess fanatic.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.470
I didn't expect

07:55.770 --> 07:58.120
you to be such a coward.

07:58.830 --> 08:02.030
It's a disgrace to the reputation
of the national player.

08:04.200 --> 08:05.790
[Fugui, Xuanjia Army Deputy General,
Nan Heng's Attendant]

08:10.750 --> 08:13.160
Who created this game?

08:15.270 --> 08:17.930
When I learned that you led
your army southward,

08:18.070 --> 08:19.360
I came up with

08:19.390 --> 08:21.790
this game of life and death overnight

08:22.590 --> 08:24.110
for you to solve.

08:24.690 --> 08:26.070
A game of life and death?

08:26.600 --> 08:28.120
You want to bet your life with me?

08:28.120 --> 08:28.920
That's right.

08:29.430 --> 08:31.390
As long as you solve this game

08:31.410 --> 08:32.539
within half an hour,

08:33.080 --> 08:33.870
I

08:34.380 --> 08:36.070
will die for my country.

08:36.720 --> 08:38.780
You can take down Youcheng

08:39.000 --> 08:40.860
without losing a single soldier.

08:41.320 --> 08:43.020
If I want to take Youcheng,

08:43.039 --> 08:45.480
I can do it by attacking
with 30,000 soldiers.

08:45.480 --> 08:48.120
Why should I fight this
small battle with you?

08:48.600 --> 08:49.870
If you attack,

08:50.360 --> 08:52.300
my 3,000 Xuanjia warriors

08:52.330 --> 08:54.140
will fight with our lives too.

08:54.910 --> 08:55.720
One life

08:56.390 --> 08:57.600
for 10 lives.

09:00.180 --> 09:02.710
Lord Qianyu, top general of Jing,

09:02.760 --> 09:04.720
just died under my sword.

09:04.750 --> 09:05.510
And his son,

09:05.510 --> 09:07.320
known as the son of a War God,

09:07.320 --> 09:08.360
Chu Guihong,

09:08.480 --> 09:10.670
also became my prisoner.

09:10.870 --> 09:13.920
You've lost three of four border cities.

09:13.940 --> 09:15.800
Even if you have heavenly skills,

09:15.830 --> 09:18.490
you won't be able to guard
this last lonely city.

09:19.730 --> 09:21.810
People fear my bloodthirstiness

09:22.150 --> 09:23.950
and insult me as the God of Death.

09:24.480 --> 09:26.480
Are you afraid too, General Fang?

09:43.440 --> 09:44.860
If I win,

09:45.120 --> 09:46.320
you'll die.

09:46.790 --> 09:48.120
If I lose,

09:48.750 --> 09:49.840
what do you want?

09:53.560 --> 09:55.400
Give Chu Guihong to me.

09:57.660 --> 10:00.660
Everyone knows you didn't
get along with Lord Qianyu.

10:00.910 --> 10:02.870
Why would you save his son?

10:03.510 --> 10:05.120
I'm not trying to save him.

10:06.630 --> 10:07.700
I want to

10:08.300 --> 10:10.110
kill him myself.

10:11.790 --> 10:13.390
You want to kill Chu Guihong?

10:13.390 --> 10:14.120
Yes.

10:14.530 --> 10:16.190
I've guarded the border for three years

10:16.190 --> 10:17.340
without any accomplishments

10:17.340 --> 10:19.200
because I was restrained by Lord Qianyu

10:19.200 --> 10:21.150
and trapped in Youcheng.

10:22.470 --> 10:25.400
The Emperor of Great Jing sent you
to guard Youcheng,

10:25.420 --> 10:28.300
while having Lord Qianyu
discipline you strictly.

10:29.270 --> 10:31.270
I'm afraid he had ulterior motives.

10:37.360 --> 10:39.380
Do you know what Youcheng is?

10:37.500 --> 10:39.330
[Youcheng]

10:39.430 --> 10:41.350
It means confinement.

10:43.530 --> 10:45.370
You are so frank.

10:46.240 --> 10:47.700
This game is interesting.

10:48.080 --> 10:49.600
Very interesting.

11:53.150 --> 11:54.000
General Fang.

11:55.320 --> 11:56.200
You lost.

11:58.270 --> 11:59.630
Can you hand him over now?

11:59.630 --> 12:00.270
Hold on.

12:00.270 --> 12:01.960
Wait for me to get my brush,
ink and inkstone,

12:01.960 --> 12:03.910
and write down this legendary chessplay.

12:03.910 --> 12:04.870
Don't bother.

12:10.600 --> 12:11.720
These ivory and ebony pieces

12:11.720 --> 12:12.840
are top grade.

12:13.150 --> 12:13.960
Take this

12:14.000 --> 12:16.480
as a gift from me to you.

12:20.810 --> 12:26.830
[Youcheng]

12:34.200 --> 12:36.160
Your Highness, let's go quickly.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.680
What if they shoot at us?

12:37.790 --> 12:39.320
Don't worry. They dare not.

12:39.480 --> 12:40.370
This...

12:40.480 --> 12:41.320
They don't dare to shoot you,

12:41.320 --> 12:42.480
but they dare to shoot me.

12:42.480 --> 12:44.200
Who would care about my cheap life?

12:44.200 --> 12:45.390
If I were turned into a porcupine,

12:45.390 --> 12:46.480
who would serve you?

12:46.480 --> 12:47.440
I'm leaving.

12:48.540 --> 12:51.450
[Youcheng]

12:48.840 --> 12:50.000
Hurry up.

12:51.510 --> 12:52.320
General.

12:52.320 --> 12:53.150
Don't let his Empty Fort Strategy

12:53.150 --> 12:54.120
scare us.

12:54.610 --> 12:56.200
Please give the order to attack the city!

12:56.200 --> 12:58.460
Please give the order to attack the city!

12:58.480 --> 13:00.770
Please give the order to attack the city!

13:07.360 --> 13:08.690
Those who cross the line

13:09.510 --> 13:10.370
will be killed!

13:10.510 --> 13:11.740
With 10 times the soldiers,

13:11.740 --> 13:13.340
I'll only surround the city.

13:13.390 --> 13:15.150
I don't need to attack the city at all.

13:15.150 --> 13:18.360
I just need to wait until the provisions
in the city run out.

13:18.360 --> 13:19.710
Then in three days,

13:20.390 --> 13:21.980
we'll fight to the death.

13:22.120 --> 13:24.380
The Emperor of Great Jing wants you dead.

13:24.440 --> 13:26.770
He won't send reinforcements to save you.

13:28.920 --> 13:37.340
[Youcheng]

13:29.840 --> 13:30.790
Nan Heng,

13:30.870 --> 13:33.930
do you have a special name for
the game of life and death?

13:34.240 --> 13:35.840
The sound of wind and cranes.

13:38.390 --> 13:40.120
The sound of wind and cranes...

13:40.480 --> 13:42.200
General, he insulted us.

13:42.270 --> 13:43.290
Excuse me.

13:43.600 --> 13:45.240
If I remember correctly,

13:45.320 --> 13:46.750
we were discussing

13:46.960 --> 13:48.150
my marriage, right?

13:49.000 --> 13:50.320
Then why did you keep talking about

13:50.320 --> 13:51.910
that demon Nan Heng?

13:52.320 --> 13:53.440
What does

13:53.510 --> 13:55.320
my marriage have to do with him?

13:57.480 --> 13:58.150
Could it be...

13:58.150 --> 13:59.150
I was talking about

13:59.150 --> 14:01.720
Nan Heng, the one who broke
the tortoise shell

14:01.720 --> 14:04.320
when the State Preceptor
of Jing was divining?

14:04.360 --> 14:05.840
Girl, duh.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.030
I...

14:07.030 --> 14:07.720
But...

14:07.720 --> 14:09.630
But I clearly wanted to
talk about General Chu.

14:09.630 --> 14:10.510
Why did I...

14:10.510 --> 14:11.240
Yingqiu.

14:11.240 --> 14:11.870
I...

14:12.790 --> 14:14.390
If you hadn't said anything,

14:15.120 --> 14:16.750
I wouldn't have felt something
was wrong either.

14:16.750 --> 14:18.010
What happened?

14:18.630 --> 14:19.870
I don't know.

14:19.890 --> 14:21.020
Enough.

14:21.200 --> 14:22.400
It already happened.

14:22.960 --> 14:24.120
But listen.

14:24.120 --> 14:25.320
What was he even saying?

14:25.320 --> 14:26.750
What was he even doing?

14:26.770 --> 14:28.100
He thought he was so cool

14:28.130 --> 14:29.580
with that Empty Fort Strategy.

14:29.580 --> 14:31.200
He must be a crazy fan of Zhuge Liang.

14:31.200 --> 14:32.200
Isn't he cringey?

14:33.200 --> 14:34.530
What kind of fan is that?

14:34.670 --> 14:35.550
A crazy fan.

14:35.960 --> 14:36.720
Is it food?

14:36.720 --> 14:38.640
I don't know. I haven't tried it.

14:39.030 --> 14:40.430
Okay, I got it.

14:40.480 --> 14:41.750
It's a mandatory plot

14:41.750 --> 14:43.630
forced to happen, right?

14:43.670 --> 14:45.320
But the most important thing now

14:45.320 --> 14:46.750
is my marriage,

14:46.750 --> 14:47.670
ladies.

14:47.870 --> 14:48.550
Yes.

14:48.550 --> 14:49.320
Marriage.

14:49.840 --> 14:50.860
That day,

14:51.000 --> 14:52.960
he had the most dangerous battle

14:53.200 --> 14:54.660
of his army life.

14:55.790 --> 14:57.200
In November,

14:57.200 --> 14:59.440
the Seventh Prince used three days

14:59.440 --> 15:00.720
to attack Heyuan's granary

15:00.720 --> 15:02.540
with an earth attack.

15:09.840 --> 15:10.980
What are you doing?

15:11.690 --> 15:13.290
If you delay His Highness...

15:13.790 --> 15:14.900
Get to work!

15:15.030 --> 15:15.840
Keep up.

15:16.630 --> 15:17.870
The fire blazed

15:17.870 --> 15:20.510
and the Heyuan people's grains
were burned completely.

15:20.510 --> 15:22.500
Where are the Xuanjia soldiers?

15:22.910 --> 15:23.550
Kill!

15:23.570 --> 15:25.170
Then the Seventh Prince
launched a surprise attack

15:25.170 --> 15:26.630
with the black ribbon as a symbol.

15:26.630 --> 15:29.080
The Xuanjia soldiers
who'd infiltrated Heyuan's army

15:29.080 --> 15:31.290
killed Heyuan's senior generals.

15:31.440 --> 15:32.960
Fang Shiming was furious.

15:33.150 --> 15:34.550
He held the Cold Moon Blade in his hand

15:34.550 --> 15:37.280
and fought the Seventh Prince
outside Youcheng.

15:39.430 --> 15:42.870
♪ Time flies and never
owes anyone anything ♪

15:41.000 --> 15:42.470
The Seventh Prince of Jing

15:42.500 --> 15:44.980
took the Cold Moon Blade
from Fang Shiming,

15:43.330 --> 15:45.740
♪ I stand with you
as the sun and moon quietly pass ♪

15:45.010 --> 15:47.150
killing him.

15:47.720 --> 15:50.660
♪ Shatter the world's prison
with one blow ♪

15:51.510 --> 15:53.520
♪ Even if it doesn't go down in history ♪

15:52.390 --> 15:54.200
Kill!

15:56.600 --> 15:57.440
The Xuanjia soldiers

15:57.440 --> 15:59.000
under the Seventh Prince's war drum

15:59.000 --> 16:00.150
went up one against 100

16:00.150 --> 16:03.200
and fought with the 30,000 soldiers
for three days and nights

16:03.200 --> 16:04.520
with their lives.

16:04.600 --> 16:06.950
Finally, they won the battle of Youcheng.

16:06.970 --> 16:10.990
♪ I'm willing to go with the wind ♪

16:11.660 --> 16:14.600
♪ And run into the fog with no regrets ♪

16:15.630 --> 16:18.550
♪ Even if rain pours on the path ahead ♪

16:19.480 --> 16:21.920
♪ For this life, for all beings ♪

16:21.030 --> 16:21.510
We won!

16:21.510 --> 16:22.440
We won!

16:22.130 --> 16:26.190
[Youcheng]

16:22.690 --> 16:25.110
♪ Sweeping through a
thousand years of dust ♪

16:22.790 --> 16:24.440
We won!

16:25.080 --> 16:26.150
We won!

16:26.510 --> 16:27.550
We won!

16:28.000 --> 16:28.790
We won!

16:29.120 --> 16:29.910
We won!

16:30.750 --> 16:31.550
Amazing.

16:32.430 --> 16:33.630
He's really amazing.

16:35.120 --> 16:36.870
Such an arrogant attitude

16:37.150 --> 16:39.630
is truly unprecedented.

16:40.330 --> 16:41.510
Strange.

16:42.150 --> 16:43.150
Why did I just blurt out how

16:43.150 --> 16:44.550
the Seventh Prince took
the enemy general's head

16:44.550 --> 16:46.280
from within a million soldiers

16:46.480 --> 16:48.400
and is so brave and invincible?

16:48.870 --> 16:49.670
Yes.

16:50.550 --> 16:52.240
It's my first time hearing

16:52.240 --> 16:54.360
the stories of Great Jing's God of Death.

16:54.360 --> 16:55.280
But...

16:55.630 --> 16:58.220
I can't help but admiring him,

16:58.720 --> 17:00.870
like I want to kneel by his feet.

17:02.270 --> 17:03.720
What's wrong with me?

17:04.200 --> 17:05.750
I finally understand.

17:06.790 --> 17:08.160
In this world,

17:08.829 --> 17:11.000
no one can escape from

17:11.109 --> 17:13.150
his halo as the main character.

17:13.310 --> 17:15.240
It's like this for you characters.

17:15.920 --> 17:17.470
Me too.

17:18.440 --> 17:19.349
My Lady,

17:19.349 --> 17:20.510
give me another chance.

17:20.510 --> 17:21.960
I'll say it well this time.

17:21.960 --> 17:22.720
No need.

17:22.880 --> 17:24.920
I've heard about his brain and brawn.

17:24.920 --> 17:25.720
Anyway,

17:26.270 --> 17:29.200
his sinister image as the God of Death

17:29.310 --> 17:31.000
is very stable.

17:31.000 --> 17:31.880
Go on.

17:32.000 --> 17:32.790
Go on.

17:33.350 --> 17:34.680
I'd like to hear

17:34.680 --> 17:36.270
what else you can say.

17:37.070 --> 17:37.880
Go ahead.

17:40.110 --> 17:40.920
That day,

17:41.730 --> 17:45.430
[Youcheng Execution Ground]

17:41.790 --> 17:43.680
he personally opened the gate

17:43.960 --> 17:45.790
to return to the capital.

17:59.560 --> 18:00.640
-Kneel!
-Kneel!

18:07.720 --> 18:09.200
Criminal Chu Guihong,

18:09.920 --> 18:12.520
you misjudged the enemy
and acted recklessly,

18:12.660 --> 18:14.310
losing three cities at the border

18:14.310 --> 18:16.570
and letting all civilians be massacred.

18:16.960 --> 18:18.000
It's noon.

18:18.790 --> 18:19.590
Execute him!

18:35.510 --> 18:36.310
Jixiang?

18:36.920 --> 18:38.520
The Eighteenth Prince is here too.

18:38.520 --> 18:39.880
[Jixiang, Nan Rui's Attendant]

18:40.110 --> 18:40.880
Jixiang, no!

18:40.880 --> 18:41.680
The horse is deaf.

18:41.680 --> 18:43.110
It won't listen to me.

18:44.550 --> 18:45.510
Cousin, don't be afraid.

18:45.510 --> 18:46.310
I'm here.

18:46.310 --> 18:48.340
No one dares to bully you anymore.

18:49.340 --> 18:51.550
[Eighteenth Prince, Nan Rui]

18:49.550 --> 18:50.560
Heng,

18:50.880 --> 18:51.680
let him go.

18:54.000 --> 18:55.400
What are you waiting for?

18:56.310 --> 18:57.240
What are you doing?

18:57.240 --> 18:58.030
Stand there.

18:58.550 --> 18:59.440
What are you doing?

18:59.440 --> 19:00.500
What are you doing?

19:02.000 --> 19:04.000
Heng, I'm telling you,

19:04.310 --> 19:05.480
Father has ordered

19:05.480 --> 19:07.070
to pardon my cousin.

19:07.070 --> 19:07.830
If you're smart,

19:07.830 --> 19:09.070
let him go right now.

19:12.440 --> 19:14.040
Where is the imperial edict?

19:15.750 --> 19:16.550
Imp...

19:17.510 --> 19:17.960
Imp...

19:18.590 --> 19:19.440
Where is it?

19:21.440 --> 19:23.030
The Chief Secretariat asked for it

19:23.030 --> 19:24.480
and it's being written.

19:24.480 --> 19:26.790
He's on his way here.

19:28.750 --> 19:30.280
That means there isn't one.

19:31.550 --> 19:32.350
Kill!

19:33.090 --> 19:34.120
Don't kill him!

19:34.480 --> 19:35.270
Heng!

19:36.920 --> 19:38.340
Stop!

19:41.400 --> 19:42.710
Seventh Prince,

19:43.350 --> 19:44.160
it's me.

19:49.440 --> 19:50.200
Isn’t this

19:50.200 --> 19:52.310
Mr. Song, the Duke of Guangping,
Vice Minister of Personnel,

19:52.310 --> 19:53.790
and Minister of War?

19:53.790 --> 19:54.640
What took you so long?

19:54.640 --> 19:56.240
I was so worried.

19:56.550 --> 19:57.640
Wait, Mr. Song,

19:58.200 --> 19:59.750
why do you look like this?

20:02.270 --> 20:03.590
Did you run into

20:03.610 --> 20:04.960
bandits on the way?

20:05.240 --> 20:06.160
No, no.

20:06.400 --> 20:08.110
I dressed like this

20:08.110 --> 20:09.830
to observe the people

20:09.960 --> 20:11.450
in disguise.

20:11.510 --> 20:13.570
Last night, the guards reported that

20:14.480 --> 20:17.550
a creepy old beggar

20:17.590 --> 20:19.480
hid in a tavern in the west of the city.

20:19.480 --> 20:20.480
Could it have been

20:21.030 --> 20:22.440
you, Mr. Song?

20:25.960 --> 20:29.020
It turns out that Your Highness
has already made plans.

20:29.080 --> 20:30.710
Sorry for being rude.

20:31.550 --> 20:32.350
Hey,

20:32.590 --> 20:33.400
Mr. Song,

20:33.590 --> 20:35.440
you've been here since last night?

20:35.440 --> 20:37.590
Why did you just show up now?

20:37.640 --> 20:38.440
Well,

20:39.300 --> 20:41.400
I caught a cold last night.

20:41.480 --> 20:42.510
After sleeping all day,

20:42.510 --> 20:44.830
I still feel a little dizzy.

20:45.790 --> 20:46.720
Rui,

20:46.960 --> 20:48.220
don't you understand?

20:48.270 --> 20:50.200
Mr. Song was hiding in the shadows,

20:50.200 --> 20:52.600
waiting for you to stand up
for Chu Guihong.

20:53.160 --> 20:54.150
Mr. Song,

20:54.200 --> 20:55.200
don't tell me

20:55.200 --> 20:56.820
you wanted to see me
make a fool of myself in public?

20:56.820 --> 20:57.610
Actually,

20:57.640 --> 20:58.510
Mr. Song

20:58.680 --> 21:00.400
just wanted to see brothers
fight against each other,

21:00.400 --> 21:01.200
then

21:01.270 --> 21:03.380
reap the benefits.

21:03.550 --> 21:04.240
No, no, no.

21:04.310 --> 21:05.310
Why are you...

21:05.750 --> 21:07.550
His Majesty has issued an edict.

21:08.880 --> 21:10.530
Kneel and listen.

21:13.310 --> 21:14.170
As there remain

21:14.480 --> 21:16.230
doubts in the case of Chu Guihong

21:16.230 --> 21:17.690
under your jurisdiction,

21:17.880 --> 21:18.830
he shall be

21:17.920 --> 21:20.500
[Imperial Edict]

21:19.240 --> 21:20.500
brought to the capital

21:20.920 --> 21:22.820
for a separate adjudication.

21:23.200 --> 21:24.640
Father is wise.

21:27.680 --> 21:28.590
Your Highness,

21:30.030 --> 21:31.070
accept the edict.

21:37.880 --> 21:38.680
I

21:39.310 --> 21:40.920
believe His Majesty's judgment

21:40.920 --> 21:42.030
is unfair.

21:42.570 --> 21:43.970
I can't follow the order.

21:44.440 --> 21:45.200
I...

21:45.200 --> 21:46.260
Your Highness,

21:46.510 --> 21:48.840
are you going against the imperial edict?

21:49.680 --> 21:51.350
When a general is on a campaign,

21:51.350 --> 21:53.400
imperial orders may not be fully obeyed.

21:53.400 --> 21:55.590
That is exactly what

21:56.270 --> 21:58.720
His Majesty worries about.

22:01.400 --> 22:02.200
I

22:02.830 --> 22:04.480
can share his burden.

22:05.510 --> 22:06.880
How so?

22:08.400 --> 22:10.790
As long as His Majesty allows me
to return to the capital,

22:10.790 --> 22:13.070
I'm willing to only bring
my personal soldiers

22:13.070 --> 22:13.880
to personally

22:14.150 --> 22:16.260
escort Chu Guihong to the capital.

22:20.200 --> 22:21.240
Oh no.

22:21.720 --> 22:24.400
My father is involved in this too?

22:25.200 --> 22:26.920
Master was His Majesty's study partner.

22:26.920 --> 22:28.830
His Majesty favors him the most.

22:28.830 --> 22:30.110
Since the late Empress passed away,

22:30.110 --> 22:31.070
His Majesty has been depressed.

22:31.070 --> 22:31.830
Apart from meetings,

22:31.830 --> 22:32.830
he rarely sees officials,

22:32.830 --> 22:34.830
but Master is the most trustworthy.

22:35.880 --> 22:38.540
Isn't it good to be a rich
and powerful official?

22:38.680 --> 22:42.140
Why does he have to be involved
with choosing the crown prince?

22:42.310 --> 22:43.720
I want to slack off,

22:44.030 --> 22:45.830
but my teammates hold me back.

22:47.270 --> 22:48.350
From now on,

22:48.510 --> 22:49.680
there is only one rule,

22:49.680 --> 22:50.480
which is to

22:50.480 --> 22:53.110
draw a line with
all the people surnamed Nan.

22:53.920 --> 22:56.320
If you don't want to
die in Nan Heng's hands,

22:56.590 --> 22:57.520
hanging in there

22:57.790 --> 22:59.390
is the most important thing.

23:01.260 --> 23:04.570
[Suzhang Gate]

23:02.590 --> 23:05.070
Run! The God of Death is back!

23:08.130 --> 23:11.630
Prince Qi Nan Heng, commander of
the Xuanjia Army, returned to the capital.

23:11.750 --> 23:13.490
The court and people were in shock.

23:13.780 --> 23:14.590
In the capital,

23:14.590 --> 23:18.740
the emperor favored the son
of the late empress, Prince Teng Nan Rui.

23:19.270 --> 23:22.780
However, Nan Heng and his mother's
Gao family are powerful

23:23.050 --> 23:25.040
His Majesty feared them.

23:25.680 --> 23:26.510
So,

23:26.830 --> 23:29.960
since the cavalry entered the city gate,

23:30.240 --> 23:32.680
a bloody storm

23:32.790 --> 23:34.680
was imminent.

23:39.110 --> 23:41.310
Mother, he's going to eat people.

23:41.310 --> 23:42.110
Shush.

23:51.640 --> 23:52.720
The imperial prison is ahead.

23:52.720 --> 23:53.680
Bring him out.

24:03.350 --> 24:05.350
Your Highness, we’ll take him away.

24:07.030 --> 24:09.160
General Chu, you’ve suffered.

24:09.180 --> 24:11.590
General Chu, you’ve suffered.

24:11.610 --> 24:14.000
-You’ve suffered.
-You’ve suffered.

24:13.380 --> 24:15.040
[Disciples of the Chu Family]

24:14.000 --> 24:15.730
General Chu, you’ve suffered.

24:21.070 --> 24:22.160
Quickly get up.

24:23.040 --> 24:24.310
No need to do this.

24:24.590 --> 24:27.850
You safeguarded borders,
achieving numerous victories.

24:28.000 --> 24:28.790
But now,

24:29.000 --> 24:30.400
you were harmed

24:30.590 --> 24:31.850
and ended up like this.

24:32.470 --> 24:34.390
This is a great injustice.

24:34.440 --> 24:36.170
General Chu is innocent!

24:36.200 --> 24:37.440
General Chu is innocent!

24:37.440 --> 24:38.240
Shut up!

24:39.240 --> 24:40.070
Where did these scoundrels

24:40.070 --> 24:41.750
spouting nonsense come from?

24:43.270 --> 24:46.030
The hero who defeated
the million Heyuan soldiers

24:46.030 --> 24:47.480
is the invincible and heroic

24:47.480 --> 24:49.110
Seventh Prince!

24:49.680 --> 24:52.000
If it weren’t for his wise trick,

24:52.030 --> 24:52.790
Chu Guihong

24:52.790 --> 24:55.000
would've been killed by the Heyuan people.

24:55.000 --> 24:57.200
You wouldn't get to stand up for him now.

24:57.550 --> 24:58.880
A tyrant’s dog barking at a virtuous king,

24:58.880 --> 25:00.400
spewing filth with every word!

25:00.400 --> 25:01.200
I...

25:02.880 --> 25:03.740
Your Highness,

25:03.880 --> 25:05.680
I understand the "spewing filth" part,

25:05.680 --> 25:07.830
but what does the other part mean?

25:12.880 --> 25:14.410
Be careful, Your Highness!

25:31.920 --> 25:33.030
As expected,

25:33.110 --> 25:34.680
no one cares about me.

26:01.150 --> 26:02.650
Your Majesty,

26:02.770 --> 26:04.970
Seventh Prince has entered the palace.

26:11.480 --> 26:13.430
[Nan Xu, Emperor of Great Jing]

26:13.030 --> 26:13.830
Summon him.

26:14.200 --> 26:15.000
Summoning

26:15.000 --> 26:16.750
the Seventh Prince, Nan Heng,

26:16.750 --> 26:18.070
to have an audience.

26:49.000 --> 26:50.460
Greetings, Your Majesty.

26:51.550 --> 26:54.960
Long live Your Majesty.

27:38.310 --> 27:40.310
Seeing you are healthy,

27:40.550 --> 27:42.160
I am very happy.

27:48.070 --> 27:48.880
Rui.

27:49.830 --> 27:52.240
Recently, there is a rumor in the capital.

27:53.030 --> 27:54.240
Have you heard of it?

27:56.640 --> 27:57.440
I don't know.

27:57.440 --> 27:58.510
Please tell me.

27:59.480 --> 28:01.350
Everyone says the God of Death

28:01.480 --> 28:02.720
is ambitious

28:03.070 --> 28:04.670
and colluded with the enemy,

28:05.000 --> 28:08.000
killed Lord Qianyu by the enemy's hand,

28:08.070 --> 28:10.730
and took the four cities at
the border as his own.

28:11.400 --> 28:12.920
If this is true,

28:14.030 --> 28:15.200
what crime is this?

28:20.070 --> 28:21.550
Colluding with the enemy

28:21.550 --> 28:22.830
is unforgivable.

28:23.240 --> 28:24.640
He deserves to be killed.

28:25.640 --> 28:26.440
Yes.

28:28.750 --> 28:29.550
Your Majesty,

28:30.830 --> 28:32.830
if I really colluded with the enemy,

28:33.350 --> 28:35.410
why would I have killed Fang Shiming,

28:35.790 --> 28:37.750
top Heyuan general, in front of

28:37.960 --> 28:39.160
thousands of people?

28:40.030 --> 28:41.300
Yes, Father.

28:41.330 --> 28:42.590
He killed Fang Shiming

28:42.590 --> 28:44.580
and stole his Cold Moon Blade.

28:44.960 --> 28:45.680
I saw the sword

28:45.680 --> 28:46.920
with my own eyes.

28:46.920 --> 28:48.880
It's a rare and valuable sword.

28:48.880 --> 28:50.410
The Cold Moon Blade is real,

28:51.160 --> 28:53.490
but Fang Shiming was a body double, right?

28:56.030 --> 28:56.830
Otherwise,

28:56.880 --> 28:58.510
how could Heyuan's top general

28:58.510 --> 29:00.590
be so weak?

29:02.400 --> 29:03.200
Then...

29:03.790 --> 29:05.310
Deceiving His Majesty

29:05.310 --> 29:06.240
is unforgivable.

29:06.240 --> 29:07.640
He deserves to be killed.

29:09.510 --> 29:10.350
Yes.

29:10.960 --> 29:11.760
Your Majesty,

29:12.640 --> 29:14.310
if I really lied to you,

29:14.790 --> 29:17.350
I wouldn't have dared to
only bring 300 soldiers

29:17.350 --> 29:18.750
to the capital in a hurry.

29:20.160 --> 29:21.200
Yes, Father.

29:21.240 --> 29:22.270
That's all he has.

29:22.270 --> 29:23.310
You can punish him

29:23.310 --> 29:24.000
however

29:24.000 --> 29:25.590
you want.

29:25.750 --> 29:27.400
Even a vicious tiger won't eat its cubs.

29:27.400 --> 29:28.240
Moreover,

29:29.240 --> 29:30.750
his Xuanjia elites

29:30.790 --> 29:32.520
are still guarding the border.

29:32.550 --> 29:35.400
The Qianyu Army, the only army that
can counter the Xuanjia Army,

29:35.400 --> 29:38.130
lost half their soldiers
in the Pingrong Battle.

29:38.240 --> 29:40.440
They haven't regained their strength yet.

29:40.440 --> 29:40.900
Then...

29:42.640 --> 29:43.880
Wielding troops to elevate oneself

29:43.880 --> 29:44.880
is unforgivable.

29:44.880 --> 29:46.280
He deserves to be killed.

29:47.110 --> 29:47.920
Yes.

29:48.240 --> 29:49.040
Your Majesty.

29:49.440 --> 29:51.510
My Xuanjia elites guard the border

29:52.200 --> 29:54.600
to prevent the Heyuan from invading again.

29:55.310 --> 29:57.040
This is also what you agreed to.

29:57.400 --> 29:58.240
The emperor

29:58.510 --> 29:59.570
must keep his word.

30:01.160 --> 30:02.310
Yes, Your Majesty.

30:02.640 --> 30:03.720
The emperor must keep his word.

30:03.720 --> 30:05.160
Since you've promised him,

30:05.160 --> 30:06.920
how can you go back on your word?

30:07.160 --> 30:09.110
He's already bullying us.

30:09.920 --> 30:11.720
Why are you still defending him?

30:11.920 --> 30:12.400
I...

30:13.750 --> 30:15.270
Isn't he kneeling here?

30:15.310 --> 30:16.590
This counts as bullying?

30:16.590 --> 30:17.720
Can't you see?

30:18.110 --> 30:19.400
Although he kneels,

30:19.680 --> 30:21.240
he stands taller than you.

30:21.480 --> 30:22.920
How is that possible?

30:23.000 --> 30:23.680
Father,

30:23.680 --> 30:24.790
about this matter,

30:24.790 --> 30:27.110
Heng and I have our own advantages.

30:27.110 --> 30:28.160
He has long legs,

30:28.160 --> 30:29.070
but

30:29.350 --> 30:30.270
I have a long torso.

30:30.270 --> 30:31.510
Father, look.

30:35.500 --> 30:36.440
Father, please take a look.

30:36.440 --> 30:38.310
We're the same height when kneeling.

30:38.310 --> 30:39.110
No.

30:39.310 --> 30:40.810
I'm better than him.

30:41.000 --> 30:42.270
You idiot!

30:46.960 --> 30:48.550
We can't be the same height?

30:51.750 --> 30:52.640
Rui,

30:52.950 --> 30:53.910
don’t kneel.

30:54.200 --> 30:55.000
Get up.

31:00.380 --> 31:02.750
Find him a mansion outside the city.

31:02.920 --> 31:05.450
Tell him not to enter the palace
for no reason.

31:08.060 --> 31:09.500
Thank you, Your Majesty.

31:11.790 --> 31:12.550
Father, wait.

31:12.550 --> 31:13.680
You...

31:13.720 --> 31:16.070
You haven't finished painting
the escaping tiger.

31:16.070 --> 31:17.180
Father, look.

31:20.030 --> 31:20.830
Oh, yes.

31:21.090 --> 31:22.440
This painting

31:23.240 --> 31:25.550
is just missing an unsharpened sword.

31:26.830 --> 31:28.400
Since you are so capable,

31:29.200 --> 31:30.000
how about

31:30.160 --> 31:31.550
you add it in for me?

31:33.830 --> 31:34.640
Father,

31:34.680 --> 31:36.350
actually, I can paint
such a trivial thing too.

31:36.350 --> 31:37.480
Painting is soothing

31:37.480 --> 31:39.010
but also lowers ambitions.

31:39.070 --> 31:41.830
I'll ask Song Yude to
teach you historical books

31:41.880 --> 31:43.350
and learn the ways wise rulers

31:43.350 --> 31:44.480
governed their countries.

31:44.480 --> 31:44.960
Okay.

31:44.960 --> 31:47.060
I will work hard!

32:08.400 --> 32:10.130
When a tiger escapes their cage

32:11.790 --> 32:14.050
and a treasure is ruined inside its case,

32:23.830 --> 32:25.330
whose fault is it?

33:00.000 --> 33:00.920
Your Highness,

33:01.400 --> 33:03.730
I don't think you need to
worry about this.

33:04.070 --> 33:05.920
Even if the Eighteenth Prince

33:05.920 --> 33:08.310
has Song Yude and Chu Guihong's help,

33:08.440 --> 33:10.440
he's not your match.

33:10.960 --> 33:12.440
Back then,

33:12.830 --> 33:14.960
you went to the battlefield alone at 16

33:14.960 --> 33:16.160
and became famous with one battle.

33:16.160 --> 33:18.350
At 17, you pacified the rebellion in Shu.

33:18.350 --> 33:20.030
At 18, you recovered the western border.

33:20.030 --> 33:22.550
At 19, you killed Dongshuo's top general.

33:23.070 --> 33:24.400
May I ask

33:24.400 --> 33:26.460
which prince has such achievements?

33:27.030 --> 33:28.070
Besides,

33:28.070 --> 33:29.750
Chancellor Gao

33:29.750 --> 33:30.960
is your uncle.

33:31.350 --> 33:33.880
He's going to the Huai region to
do disaster relief in your name.

33:33.880 --> 33:34.640
Your reputation will...

33:34.640 --> 33:35.240
Enough.

33:37.310 --> 33:38.440
How much do you know

33:39.000 --> 33:39.960
about Song Yude?

33:39.960 --> 33:40.720
Well...

33:41.110 --> 33:42.920
I don't know much about him.

33:42.920 --> 33:44.640
I only know that he's the head
of the six ministries.

33:44.640 --> 33:46.510
He's important to His Majesty.

33:47.270 --> 33:48.350
I also heard that

33:48.720 --> 33:49.590
Mr. Song

33:49.590 --> 33:50.880
is tact and diplomatic.

33:50.880 --> 33:53.210
He doesn't have much contact with others.

33:53.310 --> 33:54.350
This old fox.

33:55.590 --> 33:57.510
He wanted to help Chu Guihong out,

33:57.680 --> 33:58.830
but he’s a coward.

33:59.400 --> 34:01.310
He only wants to take care of himself.

34:01.310 --> 34:02.640
And over the years,

34:02.960 --> 34:05.620
he's never dared to have
anything to do with Rui.

34:06.350 --> 34:08.280
You want to win him over?

34:10.110 --> 34:11.639
Wanting him to voluntarily

34:11.840 --> 34:13.000
join my side

34:13.070 --> 34:14.150
is not so easy.

34:15.710 --> 34:16.510
However,

34:17.880 --> 34:19.510
he has two daughters.

34:20.280 --> 34:21.550
You mean...

34:24.920 --> 34:25.960
Great idea.

34:26.760 --> 34:28.320
I also heard that Mr. Song

34:28.320 --> 34:29.840
loves his daughters so much.

34:29.840 --> 34:30.840
The older one

34:30.840 --> 34:31.880
is weak and sick.

34:32.000 --> 34:33.590
Her birth mother died young.

34:33.590 --> 34:35.070
Her personality is pretentious

34:35.070 --> 34:35.960
and unworthy.

34:36.510 --> 34:37.960
However, the younger one

34:38.360 --> 34:39.889
was born by the second wife,

34:40.000 --> 34:42.000
but she is talented

34:42.000 --> 34:43.440
and beautiful.

34:44.000 --> 34:46.460
If she entered your residence
in the future,

34:46.920 --> 34:49.000
her father would help you,

34:49.000 --> 34:50.070
even if it was for

34:50.550 --> 34:52.440
his precious daughter's sake.

34:58.400 --> 34:59.190
Wrong.

35:00.630 --> 35:01.590
What I want

35:01.710 --> 35:04.040
is the eldest daughter of the Song family.

35:04.800 --> 35:05.660
Think about it.

35:06.230 --> 35:08.030
An orphan who has been
bullied since childhood,

35:08.030 --> 35:10.090
trying to live under her stepmother,

35:10.480 --> 35:12.280
should have died many times.

35:12.880 --> 35:13.800
But now,

35:14.110 --> 35:15.770
not only is she alive and well,

35:16.070 --> 35:17.670
but also developed a pretentious

35:17.670 --> 35:19.360
and spoiled personality.

35:19.670 --> 35:21.030
Tell me why.

35:22.110 --> 35:24.170
The eldest daughter is very cunning?

35:24.400 --> 35:25.400
Wrong again.

35:26.400 --> 35:27.760
She's just a weak girl.

35:28.070 --> 35:30.070
How can she defeat those jealous women

35:30.070 --> 35:32.330
who are experienced in cunning battles?

35:32.470 --> 35:33.280
Unless

35:34.230 --> 35:36.560
it's Mr. Song who cares about
his past love

35:36.670 --> 35:38.880
and puts his longing and guilt
toward his wife

35:38.880 --> 35:40.800
on the eldest daughter.

35:41.320 --> 35:42.630
He protects

35:43.000 --> 35:44.230
and indulges her.

35:45.190 --> 35:47.510
Outsiders know that Mr. Song
loves his daughters,

35:47.510 --> 35:48.570
but they don't know

35:48.800 --> 35:50.550
that no one can be

35:50.550 --> 35:52.000
totally unbiased.

35:53.000 --> 35:54.960
As expected of you.

35:55.110 --> 35:56.150
Who can compare to you

35:56.150 --> 35:58.480
in terms of playing with people's hearts?

35:59.320 --> 36:01.180
Tomorrow is my mother's banquet.

36:01.590 --> 36:03.280
Arrange it.

36:04.000 --> 36:05.760
Bring the Song family's eldest daughter

36:05.760 --> 36:07.070
to me.

36:07.800 --> 36:08.590
Yes.

36:14.060 --> 36:17.810
[Workshop for Song Yimeng's Script]

36:20.230 --> 36:21.440
We finally created the chalk

36:21.440 --> 36:22.840
you mentioned.

36:29.060 --> 36:35.010
[Slacker Escape Plan]

36:36.430 --> 36:37.550
[Mutilated]

36:45.740 --> 36:49.550
[Slacker Escape Plan]

36:45.880 --> 36:46.670
My Lady,

36:46.760 --> 36:48.230
you've been writing and drawing all day.

36:48.230 --> 36:49.630
What is all this?

36:51.320 --> 36:52.840
What else can it be?

36:52.960 --> 36:54.110
It's the plot.

36:56.400 --> 36:59.400
We have many plots of land,

36:59.400 --> 37:01.480
but what is this written plot?

37:01.960 --> 37:03.110
It's a story plot.

37:04.000 --> 37:05.320
The PowerPoint I made

37:05.320 --> 37:06.670
can save our lives.

37:07.590 --> 37:08.440
My Lady,

37:08.440 --> 37:09.590
recently, you've been

37:09.590 --> 37:10.630
saying weird things

37:10.630 --> 37:12.230
and doing weird things.

37:12.400 --> 37:14.590
We don't even know what you're doing.

37:15.400 --> 37:17.920
Could it be that your hysteria
hasn't recovered yet?

37:17.770 --> 37:18.670
[Wedding day, 3 people spin and stab]
[Jump from the wall, choose between 2]
[Be mutilated in the cold palace]

37:17.920 --> 37:18.530
How about we ask

37:18.530 --> 37:20.600
the doctor to prescribe some
soothing medicine tomorrow?

37:20.600 --> 37:22.070
[Wedding day, 3 people spin and stab]
[Jump from the wall, choose between 2]
[Be mutilated in the cold palace]

37:20.710 --> 37:22.230
Forget it, Yingqiu.

37:22.430 --> 37:23.550
My health

37:23.590 --> 37:25.050
is much better than yours.

37:28.030 --> 37:30.840
I'm really working so hard for

37:31.000 --> 37:32.880
the original script's tragic fate.

37:32.880 --> 37:34.400
I didn't even work this hard

37:34.400 --> 37:36.060
for my college entrance exam.

37:38.400 --> 37:39.110
My Lady,

37:39.280 --> 37:40.480
I forgot the serious matter.

37:40.480 --> 37:41.880
This is the invitation from the palace

37:41.880 --> 37:43.670
sent by Royal Consort Gao.

37:43.670 --> 37:44.800
She invites you and your sister

37:44.800 --> 37:48.060
to attend the flower banquet
in the royal garden tomorrow.

37:48.190 --> 37:49.000
Stop.

37:49.510 --> 37:50.580
Don't.

37:50.710 --> 37:52.550
This blind date meeting

37:50.870 --> 37:55.510
[Lantern Festival, saved by the hero]
[Dig wild herbs, family falls apart]
[Aunt and Brother-in-law have an affair]

37:52.550 --> 37:54.280
was the one that caused Song Yimeng

37:54.280 --> 37:56.110
to fall into the devil's trap.

37:57.500 --> 38:00.180
[Lantern Festival, saved by the hero]
[Dig wild herbs, family falls apart]
[Aunt and Brother-in-law have an affair]

37:58.150 --> 37:59.090
Take it away.

37:59.360 --> 38:00.400
Just say I'm sick.

38:00.550 --> 38:01.550
Say I'm

38:01.630 --> 38:02.560
deathly ill.

38:02.580 --> 38:04.050
I'm dying.

38:04.340 --> 38:05.400
Go. Go.

38:05.030 --> 38:09.580
[Script Iconic Scenes]

38:09.680 --> 38:13.440
[1. Fall into the royal garden's water
and get saved]

38:13.540 --> 38:15.960
[Persistence]

38:15.960 --> 38:17.790
[Day of the Flower Banquet]

38:24.030 --> 38:24.760
Let's do it.

38:27.070 --> 38:27.590
My Lady.

38:27.590 --> 38:28.870
What are you doing?

38:29.230 --> 38:29.800
Get up.

38:29.800 --> 38:31.110
You'll be laughed at if you don't go now.

38:31.110 --> 38:31.630
I'm not going.

38:31.630 --> 38:32.470
Don't...

38:32.470 --> 38:33.000
Let go!

38:33.510 --> 38:34.840
Are you listening to me?

38:35.510 --> 38:36.190
Are you

38:36.190 --> 38:37.230
listening to me at all?

38:37.230 --> 38:38.000
I'm the female lead.

38:38.000 --> 38:38.840
Do I have no dignity?

38:38.840 --> 38:40.230
I can only be a tool, right?

38:40.230 --> 38:42.010
My Lady, don't move.

38:42.190 --> 38:43.110
As long as you can marry a good husband,

38:43.110 --> 38:44.280
I'll do anything.

38:44.280 --> 38:45.190
Let's go.

38:46.920 --> 38:48.090
Let me out!

38:48.140 --> 38:50.370
[Song Residence]

38:51.150 --> 38:52.980
[Song Residence]

38:52.890 --> 38:53.320
Let me go!

38:53.320 --> 38:53.800
Get down!

38:53.800 --> 38:54.670
Let go of me first.

38:54.670 --> 38:54.880
Get down!

38:54.880 --> 38:56.150
Bro, you're on their side?

38:55.360 --> 38:56.700
[Carter A]

38:56.150 --> 38:56.760
Come down.

38:56.760 --> 38:57.760
You're a character

38:57.760 --> 38:58.590
without a name.

38:58.590 --> 38:59.670
You don't have to work so hard.

38:59.540 --> 38:59.970
[Carter A]

39:00.150 --> 39:01.430
[Lackey #3]

39:00.230 --> 39:01.320
Come down.

39:01.840 --> 39:02.840
Come down.

39:06.930 --> 39:08.040
Sirs,

39:08.280 --> 39:09.550
I'm just an ordinary person.

39:09.550 --> 39:11.210
I just want to live a good life.

39:11.880 --> 39:13.280
Why is it so hard?

39:13.790 --> 39:14.490
-Hurry up.
-Hurry.

39:14.490 --> 39:15.320
-Hurry up.
-Hurry.

39:15.320 --> 39:16.010
-Hurry up.
-Hurry up.

39:15.770 --> 39:19.680
[Lackey +10086]

39:16.030 --> 39:16.870
-Hurry up.
-Hurry.

39:16.870 --> 39:17.320
Hurry up.

39:17.320 --> 39:18.000
Hurry up.

39:18.000 --> 39:18.510
Don't waste time.

39:18.510 --> 39:18.860
Hurry up.

39:18.860 --> 39:19.300
Hurry up.

39:19.300 --> 39:19.920
Hurry up.

39:20.590 --> 39:22.190
Help!

39:25.800 --> 39:26.660
Your Highness.

39:26.760 --> 39:27.920
Everything is done.

39:27.920 --> 39:30.960
The Song family's eldest daughter
has entered the palace.

39:30.960 --> 39:31.960
Bring her in.

39:32.510 --> 39:33.280
Yes.

39:55.230 --> 39:56.030
Xiang.

39:56.230 --> 39:57.150
Later,

39:57.280 --> 39:59.320
you must protect me.

40:00.000 --> 40:02.840
I haven't shown up in public
for a long time.

40:02.840 --> 40:05.190
I'm afraid the women in the capital
will be too excited

40:05.190 --> 40:07.670
because of my handsome looks.

40:08.710 --> 40:10.230
If chaos erupts,

40:10.230 --> 40:11.360
it will be bad.

40:22.550 --> 40:23.360
Jixiang,

40:23.660 --> 40:25.310
do you see that?

40:25.360 --> 40:27.550
Those two ladies were so smart.

40:27.570 --> 40:28.800
They know I've always kept a low profile

40:28.800 --> 40:30.260
and don't like to show off.

40:30.510 --> 40:31.320
Not bad.

40:32.590 --> 40:33.400
Yes.

40:33.400 --> 40:34.360
I came here

40:34.360 --> 40:36.320
for the Song family's two daughters.

40:36.320 --> 40:38.190
It wouldn't be good if I

40:38.400 --> 40:39.860
got involved with others.

40:40.510 --> 40:41.640
By the way, Jixiang,

40:41.840 --> 40:43.590
did you see the Song family's daughters?

40:43.590 --> 40:44.450
Where are they?

40:45.320 --> 40:46.670
It's the Second Miss of the Song family!

40:46.670 --> 40:48.440
The famous Second Miss

40:48.440 --> 40:50.190
lives up to her reputation.

41:22.030 --> 41:25.510
Seeing beautiful women makes one
forget all worries.

41:26.760 --> 41:27.550
Xiang,

41:28.230 --> 41:29.800
it's time to give her

41:29.960 --> 41:31.800
a chance to approach me.

41:35.490 --> 41:36.510
His Highness ordered

41:36.510 --> 41:38.110
to invite you over for a chat.

41:39.070 --> 41:40.070
The Seventh Prince ordered

41:40.070 --> 41:41.920
you must be brought to him today.

41:44.190 --> 41:45.570
Gentlemen, here's the thing.

41:45.570 --> 41:47.280
I have diarrhea today.

41:47.280 --> 41:48.800
If I act out of hand
in front of His Highness,

41:48.800 --> 41:50.230
that won't be good, right?

41:50.230 --> 41:51.000
I'm sorry.

41:51.000 --> 41:52.400
I need to go to the toilet.

41:52.440 --> 41:53.190
I don't dare to disobey

41:53.190 --> 41:54.190
His Highness's order.

41:54.190 --> 41:54.880
Miss.

41:54.960 --> 41:55.760
Please.

41:59.840 --> 42:00.670
Second Miss,

42:00.670 --> 42:01.920
I am 18 years old

42:01.920 --> 42:03.650
and good at writing and poetry.

42:03.880 --> 42:05.590
I'm from the Zhao family,
a wealthy family in Jin.

42:05.590 --> 42:07.390
I have countless grand mansion.

42:07.760 --> 42:09.360
Having mansions is nothing.

42:09.480 --> 42:11.150
My parents died last year.

42:11.360 --> 42:12.800
If you are willing to marry me,

42:12.800 --> 42:14.400
you'll have no family drama.

42:15.760 --> 42:17.280
This woman is a player.

42:17.670 --> 42:18.930
She's not a good match.

42:19.550 --> 42:20.400
Xiang,

42:20.590 --> 42:21.710
you should

42:21.840 --> 42:23.550
listen to me about love.

42:23.550 --> 42:24.840
The more competitors there are,

42:24.840 --> 42:26.800
the more it shows that
I'm the best

42:26.840 --> 42:28.030
among all.

42:30.300 --> 42:36.750
[Improve Daily]

42:30.800 --> 42:32.150
Isn’t this Song Yiting,

42:32.190 --> 42:34.320
daughter of Mr. Song,
Duke of Guangping, Vice Minister of the

42:34.320 --> 42:36.720
Ministry of Personnel and Minister of War?

42:36.800 --> 42:39.070
You are extraordinary.

42:39.070 --> 42:39.840
I

42:40.060 --> 42:41.500
admire you very much.

42:41.890 --> 42:43.730
Greetings, Your Highness.

42:43.800 --> 42:45.330
Greetings, Your Highness.

42:49.590 --> 42:50.650
As the saying goes,

42:50.710 --> 42:52.360
a famous flower for a beauty.

42:52.480 --> 42:53.630
I am Nan Rui,

42:53.710 --> 42:55.150
meaning "auspicious kirin and phoenix."

42:55.150 --> 42:56.110
When I was born,

42:56.110 --> 42:57.360
there were auspicious clouds.

42:57.360 --> 42:58.670
It was an auspicious sign.

42:58.670 --> 42:59.480
Thus, I was named

42:59.480 --> 43:00.400
Nan Rui.

43:00.440 --> 43:01.320
I wonder

43:01.440 --> 43:02.630
if I can

43:03.110 --> 43:05.440
invite you for a chat?

43:07.880 --> 43:08.740
Your Highness,

43:08.960 --> 43:09.880
I

43:09.880 --> 43:11.480
don't like chrysanthemums.

43:12.400 --> 43:13.230
No?

43:14.150 --> 43:15.110
It's okay.

43:16.190 --> 43:17.000
No?

43:22.280 --> 43:23.070
Still no?

43:27.920 --> 43:28.710
Sorry.

43:29.030 --> 43:30.000
I took the wrong one.

43:30.000 --> 43:31.400
I have it in other colors.

43:31.800 --> 43:32.830
Your Highness.

43:33.760 --> 43:35.820
A chrysanthemum is a chrysanthemum.

43:35.920 --> 43:37.230
No matter the color,

43:37.320 --> 43:38.480
I won't like it.

43:39.070 --> 43:40.280
What I like

43:40.320 --> 43:42.030
is a heroic man,

43:42.920 --> 43:45.120
instead of a prince born into nobility.

43:45.800 --> 43:46.590
Goodbye.

43:47.480 --> 43:48.280
I...

43:50.800 --> 43:52.590
No, I am a heroic man!

43:52.590 --> 43:53.880
Get to know me!

43:57.480 --> 43:58.920
Judging from the situation,

43:58.920 --> 44:00.850
they're dragging me into the plot.

44:01.760 --> 44:02.550
No.

44:02.600 --> 44:03.710
I'll die here

44:03.710 --> 44:05.030
if I see Nan Heng.

44:05.550 --> 44:06.760
It's only been a few days.

44:06.760 --> 44:08.840
My good days have just begun.

44:13.390 --> 44:14.960
Isn't this Ling Meishi?

44:15.110 --> 44:17.440
The cast list said that
she plays Jia Ruru.

44:17.630 --> 44:19.960
She's always looked down on Song Yimeng.

44:20.230 --> 44:21.920
I must fight fire with fire.

44:21.920 --> 44:23.820
Everyone is moving the plot along now.

44:23.820 --> 44:25.320
Jia Ruru is the antagonist.

44:25.320 --> 44:27.320
I can use her to stop the plot.

44:29.550 --> 44:31.510
Why am I so unlucky?

44:31.550 --> 44:32.590
As soon as I came out,

44:32.590 --> 44:34.400
I met such an annoying person.

44:35.040 --> 44:36.900
[Jia Ruru, 1st Daughter of
Imperial College's Dean]

44:35.880 --> 44:36.670
Song Yimeng.

44:37.590 --> 44:38.840
What's wrong today?

44:39.070 --> 44:40.190
Usually when we meet,

44:40.190 --> 44:41.850
you're either crying or sick.

44:42.230 --> 44:44.230
Why are you talking like this today?

44:46.000 --> 44:46.960
Xuanjia Army?

44:47.670 --> 44:49.130
The Seventh Prince's men.

44:51.800 --> 44:53.320
I'll be frank with you.

44:53.320 --> 44:54.070
Today,

44:54.070 --> 44:56.550
the Seventh Prince invited me here.

44:58.630 --> 44:59.630
Are you crazy?

45:00.000 --> 45:02.400
How dare you flirt
with the Seventh Prince?

45:03.320 --> 45:04.480
What can I do about it?

45:04.480 --> 45:05.320
In the past,

45:05.440 --> 45:07.280
Chu Guihong wanted to marry me.

45:07.280 --> 45:08.150
Now,

45:08.150 --> 45:10.210
the Seventh Prince wants to marry me.

45:10.760 --> 45:12.230
Tell me, why am I

45:12.230 --> 45:13.880
so lucky?

45:14.960 --> 45:15.760
Lucky?

45:16.110 --> 45:17.770
I don't think you'll survive.

45:19.960 --> 45:21.620
Why don't you play by the book?

45:21.840 --> 45:23.510
Shouldn't we do some palace intrigue now?

45:23.510 --> 45:24.320
Jia Ruru.

45:24.510 --> 45:25.840
Aren't you angry?

45:25.860 --> 45:27.760
Don't you want to drag me
to some dark room

45:27.760 --> 45:28.800
and beat me up?

45:29.450 --> 45:31.050
What palace? What intrigue?

45:31.320 --> 45:32.980
Do you have a fever?

45:33.190 --> 45:34.740
All you think about is making trouble.

45:34.740 --> 45:35.960
We are in the palace.

45:36.030 --> 45:37.630
Be careful of being flogged.

45:39.070 --> 45:40.230
I haven't finished yet.

45:40.230 --> 45:41.030
Jia Ruru,

45:41.070 --> 45:42.030
won't you consider

45:42.030 --> 45:43.710
locking me up in a dark room

45:43.710 --> 45:45.070
and beating me up?

46:00.510 --> 46:01.520
What's going on?

46:01.670 --> 46:03.000
Why aren't they moving?

46:08.590 --> 46:12.190
Help! The script is killing me!
